{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.H2TraceForm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.H2TraceForm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.H2AlgebraDimension","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.H2GramArithmetic","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.RegTraceGram","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.HeckeGramFactorial","lean:module:Mathlib.RingTheory.Trace.Basic"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2_isSemisimpleRing_of_one_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2_isSemisimpleRing_of_one_lt","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2TraceForm.lean#L148-L157","doc":"**The substrate discharges `H_2` semisimplicity (sorry-free).**  For any\nreal `q > 1` — in particular the physical substrate `q₀ ≈ 1.10998` —\nthe Iwahori–Hecke algebra `H_2(q)` is semisimple: `q > 1` is\nWenzl-generic at every rank (`qGeneric_of_one_lt`), and the axiom-free\nn=2 discharge applies.  This is the shape in which the substrate\nparameter discharges the semisimplicity leg of the `P ≠ NP`-in-QOU\ncounting argument at `n = 2`, with no cited class and no `sorry`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2_isSemisimpleRing_of_generic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2_isSemisimpleRing_of_generic","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2TraceForm.lean#L133-L146","doc":"**First fully axiom-free `WenzlCriterion` discharge (sorry-free).**  For\nWenzl-generic `q` (here: `q ≠ 1` and `q² ≠ 1`, i.e. `QGeneric q 2`),\nthe Iwahori–Hecke algebra `H_2(q) = AdjoinRoot(X²-(q-1)X-q)` is\nsemisimple — proved with **no cited class and no `sorry`**, by\ncomputing its regular-trace Gram determinant `[2]_q² = (1+q)·[2]_q!`\nand feeding it through `isSemisimpleRing_of_gram_det_eq_qFactorial`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2_regTraceGram_det","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2_regTraceGram_det","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2TraceForm.lean#L126-L131","doc":"**`det(Gram) = [2]_q²` for the actual `H_2(q)` regular trace form\n(sorry-free).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2_regTraceGram_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2_regTraceGram_eq","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2TraceForm.lean#L108-L124","doc":"**The regular-trace Gram matrix of `H_2(q)` in the basis `{1, σ}`\nequals `h2GramMatrix` (sorry-free).**  Each entry `tr(σⁱ·σʲ)` reduces to\nthe asserted literal via the three computed traces. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2Basis_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2Basis_apply","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2TraceForm.lean#L101-L106","doc":"**`h2Basis i = σⁱ` (sorry-free).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2Basis","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2Basis","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2TraceForm.lean#L96-L99","doc":"The power basis `{1, σ}` **reindexed to `Fin 2`** (via `dim = 2`), so\nthe Gram matrix is an honest `Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) K`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2_trace_gen_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2_trace_gen_sq","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2TraceForm.lean#L87-L94","doc":"**`tr(σ²) = q²+1` (sorry-free).**  From the root relation and the\n`K`-linearity of `Algebra.trace`: `tr(σ²) = (q-1)tr(σ) + q·tr(1)\n= (q-1)² + 2q = q²+1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2sigma_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2sigma_sq","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2TraceForm.lean#L73-L85","doc":"**The root relation `σ² = (q-1)·σ + q` (sorry-free).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2_trace_gen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2_trace_gen","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2TraceForm.lean#L58-L71","doc":"**`tr(σ) = q-1` (sorry-free).**  The power-basis generator's trace is\nminus the `nextCoeff` of its minimal polynomial `h2Poly`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2Poly_nextCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2Poly_nextCoeff","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2TraceForm.lean#L53-L56","doc":"**`nextCoeff (X²-(q-1)X-q) = -(q-1)` (sorry-free).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2_trace_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2_trace_one","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2TraceForm.lean#L45-L51","doc":"**`tr(1) = 2` (sorry-free).**  Via `trace(algebraMap 1) = dim • 1` and\n`dim H_2(q) = 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h2sigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h2sigma","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2TraceForm.lean#L42-L43","doc":"The Hecke generator `σ = root(h2Poly q)` inside `H_2(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.regTraceForm_eq_trace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.regTraceForm_eq_trace","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/H2TraceForm.lean#L36-L40","doc":"`regTraceForm = Algebra.trace (x*y)` on a commutative algebra\n(sorry-free): both are `LinearMap.trace (lmul (x*y))`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}